  "bodyHash": "OC6SsH31Mjs=",
  "content": "<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/banner.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p><p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersivePaintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Github\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fimmersive-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"通过 Crowdin 翻译\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=crowdin&amp;color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p><p>\n厌倦了像素化过度、数量有限且没有合适选择界面的画作？\n沉浸式画作允许用户通过拖放、截图或提供URL的方式，创建自己的Minecraft风格画作。\n无需资源包，支持多人游戏，简单易用。\n</p><p>本模组提供了一个简洁而强大的界面，用于选择您自己的画作、其他玩家的作品或通过可选数据包提供的画作。默认数据包可供快速上手！</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/selector.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p><p>创作菜单允许您快速将图像像素化，并应用后期效果和抖动处理，使其看起来更贴合Minecraft风格，无需过多调整。</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/editor.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p><p>但一幅精美的画作怎能没有精美的画框？从多种风格和大量材质中选择，让您的艺术作品更加突出。</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/frames.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p><p>通过智能细节层次、缓存和数据的延迟流式传输，性能影响几乎可以忽略不计。</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/multi.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p><p>还提供发光颜料！</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/glow.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p><p>您的图像有透明背景？没问题，使用涂鸦功能，将其喷涂到任何墙壁上！</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/alpha.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p><p>这是合成配方。</p><p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/recipes?minecraft_version=1.20.1&amp;locations=immersive_paintings:.*&amp;dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersivePaintings/tree/1.20.1&amp;resolution=48&amp;animated=False&amp;row_width=835\" alt=\"生成的配方图像\"></p><p>\n兼容<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/joy-of-painting\" rel=\"nofollow\">绘画之乐</a>！\n只需将画布贴在画作上即可展示！\n</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/joy.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p><h1>服务器管理员须知</h1><p>\n沉浸式画作需要传输和存储图像，在服务器上可能会占用大量资源。如果您的服务器带宽或存储空间有限，请查看\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersivePaintings/wiki/Config\" rel=\"nofollow\">配置文件</a>。\n它允许对用户进行一些限制，并支持带宽节流，以适应您的需求。\n</p><h1>数据包</h1><p>\n可选地，使用<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersivePaintings/wiki/Custom-Paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">数据包</a>分享画作包。\n</p><h1>翻译</h1><p>\n您希望模组支持您的语言吗？请在\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fimmersive-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crowdin</a>\n上帮助翻译本模组。\n</p><h1>沉浸式系列</h1><p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式盔甲&amp;description=大量独特且忠于原版风格的盔甲套装。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式盔甲\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式飞行器&amp;description=一系列复古风格的飞行器，用于旅行、运输和探索！&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式飞行器\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-melodies\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式旋律&amp;description=在各种乐器上演奏自定义旋律，烦扰您的朋友！&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式旋律\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式画作&amp;description=拖放、像素化并悬挂美丽的艺术作品。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式画作\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-optimization\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式优化&amp;description=轻量级实体刻调度器，可让您的TPS翻倍。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式优化\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selectivebounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=选择性边界&amp;description=在不相关时隐藏难看的方块选择轮廓。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"选择性边界\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/man-of-many-planes\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=多面手&amp;description=为沉浸式飞行器添加更多飞行器，并支持机械动力模组。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"多面手\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-machinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式机械&amp;description=一系列复古风格的机械，用于运输、采矿和自动化。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式机械\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-furniture\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式家具&amp;description=在游戏中创建自定义和精美的家具，或从庞大的在线库中选择。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式家具\">\n</a></p><h1>附加组件</h1><p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings-faithful-addon\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Faithful 附加组件&amp;description=适用于 Faithful 的 32px 纹理包附加组件。&amp;icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/629/725/64/64/638028066470632891.jpeg&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Faithful 附加组件\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252farids-immersive-resprites\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Arids 沉浸式重制纹理&amp;description=为沉浸式旋律和沉浸式画作模组重制的纹理！&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/common/icons/arids-immersive-resprites.webp&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Arids 沉浸式重制纹理\">\n</a></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=6686e86ace76d31262ccd37a5e7f80ba\" alt=\"页面哈希值，便于页面部署。\"></p>",
